  > ○ Bring your own

  Already run your own reverse proxy, such as SWAG, Pangolin, Nginx Proxy Manager, Traefik or
  Caddy? Choosing this changes nothing here. Run self-host access export to print where each App
  lives, then give it to your proxy. You stay in charge of names, certificates and who gets in.
  Home network keeps working. This one is for advanced users.

